DESCRIPTION:Jose Not Juan\n\nJose Not Juan is a rising Latino comedian know
 n for his hilarious and relatable takes on family\, culture\, relationships
 \, and everyday life. His comedy has connected with audiences through his v
 iral clips and unforgettable characters\, including fan favorites Grandma P
 aula\, Hood Dora\, and his popular Besties reels\, just to name a few. His 
 authentic storytelling\, quick wit\, and larger-than-life personalities hav
 e helped take his comedy from social media to the live stage.\n\nJose has b
 een featured on Netflix and SiriusXM’s It Was A Joke Radio and most recen
 tly served as a host for the 2026 San Diego Pride Festival. Whether audienc
 es first discovered him through one of his viral characters or are seeing h
 im live for the first time\, Jose brings the same high-energy\, unapologeti
 cally funny style that continues to make him an exciting voice in comedy.\n
 \nNana Rodriguez\n\nNana Rodriguez brings a bold point of view\, a little a
 ttitude\, and no shortage of opinions to the stage. She finds the funny in 
 family\, relationships\, getting older\, Latino culture\, and the life expe
 riences that have shaped her unapologetic perspective.\n\nShe has performed
  at the Latina Comedy Festival\, Laugh After Dark Comedy Fest\, and others 
 and for Mario Lopez’s “Wey Out Loud\,” carving out a comedic style th
 at is unmistakably her own. Relatable and never afraid to laugh at herself 
 or anyone else in the room. Nana makes every show feel spontaneous\, person
 al\, and just a little unpredictable. She’s loud\, Latina\, unfiltered\, 
 and always ready to say what everyone else was thinking.\n\nCouples Package
  includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per pers
 on)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\n**The Private Skybox Suite includes
